      "content": "i basically spent my whole life building this one version of myself. the smart one, the one with the career, the one who actually mattered. and now that the dissertation is pulled and the department is basically blacklisting me... i dont even know who is left. it feels like all that work was for nothing. like there's just nothing underneath the achievements. just an empty shell.",
